  "summary": "The Switch 2 Edition of Tears of the Kingdom is the original 2023 game with an upgrade that raises resolution and frame rate: up to 1440p at 60 FPS on the TV and 648p to 1080p at 60 FPS in handheld mode, compared with 30 FPS on Switch 1. If you already own the Switch 1 version you do not have to buy it again: the upgrade pack costs $9.99, and it is included with Nintendo Switch Online + Expansion Pack. The install grows from 16.5 GB on Switch 1 to 20.1 GB on Switch 2, a small jump for what you get. The physical Switch 2 Edition has the full game on the cartridge, and it supports 15 languages, including Spanish.",
